    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3306" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκονάω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόνη</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sharpen</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαχαίρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					684
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.2.33
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκονᾶσθαι μαχαίρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.5.20
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				886b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
